        "reason": "The claim is a written scope statement (which domain a change touches, with source locations), not an executable behaviour. Console sessions carry no device id in GatewaySessionStore.SessionRecord, so no test can assert the boundary; the source reading is the evidence.",
        "steps": "Read openspec/changes/profile-multidevice/design.md and compare it with js/profileDevices.js (device identity readout and sign-out scoping), src/main/scala/nebflow/gateway/NeblinkRoutes.scala:546-590 (device-scoped route) and the SessionRecord definition (no device id field).",
